  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "ASC Studio",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nEdit App Store Connect listing text and images in the [DeepSeek Harness](https://deepseek.com/harness/) sidebar."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Edit localized names, subtitles, descriptions, keywords, release notes, and promotional text.\n- Review changes before syncing, with character counts and checks for conflicting edits in ASC.\n- Upload, reorder, and delete screenshots; manage product page headers and search result images.\n- Preview product and search pages in a device layout.\n- Ask the DSH Agent to draft copy and translations, or summarize Git changes into release notes.\n- English and Simplified Chinese interface, with light and dark themes that follow DSH."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires **macOS** and DSH **>=0.2.1-rc.5, <0.3.0**. Tested with DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 in desktop and Web modes on macOS.\n\nIn DSH, open **Plugins → Add Plugin** and install:\n\n```text\ndsh-asc-studio@0.1.4\n```\n\nOpen the **App Store** panel and connect with your App Store Connect API credentials: Issuer ID, Key ID, and `.p8` file.\n\nThe plugin edits existing versions and languages. Creating versions, adding languages, and submitting for review remain in App Store Connect."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "ASC Studio checks for updates when opened and shows a notice when a newer release is available. You can also check in Settings. On DSH 0.2.1-rc.5, follow the notice’s update guide: uninstall from DSH's plugin manager, then add the exact package version shown in the guide. A very recent release may not be selected by `@latest` because of the package manager’s release-age policy. This keeps local data and Keychain credentials. The cleanup-and-uninstall action inside ASC Studio deletes them."
    },
    {
      "section": "Agent workflow",
      "text": "Open your project in DSH and ask, for example:\n\n> Draft release notes from the Git changes since v1.2.0 and fill the current App Store version’s English and Chinese drafts.\n\nThe Agent prepares drafts. You review and sync them in the panel."
    },
    {
      "section": "Data and privacy",
      "text": "Update checks request only public package metadata from npm and cache results in memory for six hours. They do not send ASC credentials, listing text, or images.\n\nAPI private keys are stored in macOS Keychain. Local preview images can be cleared in settings. Use the plugin’s cleanup action before uninstalling to remove its local data and credentials."
    },
    {
      "section": "Data and privacy",
      "text": "DSH may retain Agent conversations. When using a cloud model, listing text and project content read by the Agent are sent to that model provider. The plugin does not expose private keys to Agent tools."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "Use Node.js 24, then run:\n\n```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run check\n```\n\nFor local development, install the repository’s absolute path through DSH’s plugin manager.\n\nPushes to `main` run checks and publish to npm when the package version is new. Keep the versions in `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, and `lib/client.js` in sync. Publishing uses npm trusted publishing through the `npm` GitHub environment."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE). An independent community plugin, not affiliated with Apple or DeepSeek."
    },
    {
      "section": "ASC Studio",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | 中文\n\n在 [DeepSeek Harness](https://deepseek.com/harness/) 侧边栏编辑 App Store Connect 上架文案及图片。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 编辑多语言名称、副标题、描述、关键词、更新说明和推广文本。\n- 提供字数统计和同步前对比，检查 ASC 中的文案是否已被他人修改。\n- 上传、排序和删除截图，管理产品页头图和搜索结果图。\n- 通过设备布局预览产品页和搜索页。\n- 让 DSH Agent 起草文案、翻译内容，或根据 Git 改动整理更新说明。\n- 支持简体中文和英文界面，浅色与深色主题跟随 DSH。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "需要 **macOS** 和 DSH **>=0.2.1-rc.5、<0.3.0**。已在 macOS 的 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 桌面端及 Web 模式中验证。\n\n在 DSH 的 **插件 → 添加插件** 中安装：\n\n```text\ndsh-asc-studio@0.1.4\n```\n\n打开 **App Store** 面板，使用 App Store Connect API 的 Issuer ID、Key ID 和 `.p8` 文件连接账号。\n\n插件用于编辑已有版本和语言。新建版本、添加语言和提交审核仍在 App Store Connect 中完成。\n\n打开 ASC Studio 时会自动检查更新，有新版时显示提示，也可在设置中手动检查。在 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 中，按提示里的更新指引操作：从 DSH 插件管理页卸载，再添加指引中显示的确切包版本。刚发布的版本可能受到包管理器等待期限制，使用 `@latest` 仍可能装到旧版。这种方式保留插件本地数据和钥匙串凭据；ASC Studio 内的“清理并卸载”会删除这些数据。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Agent 协作",
      "text": "在 DSH 打开项目后，可以这样提出要求：\n\n> 根据 Git 中 v1.2.0 以来的改动生成更新说明，填入当前 App Store 版本的中文和英文草稿。\n\nAgent 负责起草，文案由你在面板中核对并同步。"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据与隐私",
